Dynarmic vendored snapshot.

Source: https://github.com/lioncash/dynarmic (mirror of merryhime/dynarmic).
Version: 6.7.0, commit a41c380 (2024-03-03).
License: ISC (see LICENSE.txt). Dependencies under `externals/` retain their
upstream licenses.

Vendored so host, Android, and CI builds do not fetch native dependencies. To
upgrade, replace this tree and update the pinned version and commit above.
